	"Description": "Current version includes five skins based on real chicken varieties:\n<br />\n<br />-Black Maran\n<br />-Gold Laced Cochin\n<br />-Lakenvelder\n<br />-Lavender Orpington\n<br />-Rhode Island Red\n<br />\n<br />I highly recommend using the Adopt 'n' Skin mod. This will both make reskinning easy and allow you to use as many skins as you want.\n<br />\n<br />Feel free to request more breeds! These are just very simple recolors, but I plan to do some more detailed skins in the future and possibly add green and blue eggs as products to better match up the chickens and eggs. \n<br />\n<br />The \"All Colors\" folder has each skin named appropriately to work in the Adopt 'n' Skin mod. I placed them as white or brown chicken at random, so feel free to switch them around if you don't want to break your immersion with improper egg colors.",
